  "_readme": "Qwen registry keys hash four UTF-8 components: source, native root session, native tool call and workflow dispatch (empty for a root). Each component starts with its unsigned eight-byte big-endian byte length. Prefix the lowercase SHA-256 hex digest with the shared Qwen registry prefix. Empty required identities produce no key. JSON-decoded lone surrogates encode as U+FFFD in both readers. These fixed digests were computed independently with Python hashlib and struct.",
